         only strings that end up stored in the database rather than read straight
         from here: a start-up pass writes them into muscle.name so every catalogue
         query stays a plain name lookup, and rewrites them when the device language
         changes. Editing one here therefore renames it on every device that has not
         renamed it by hand.
